# The user's node library (PIVOT-PLAN §5.1 / D35): it ships EMPTY, so a tracked
# copy would hand a fresh clone a library nobody chose. The shipped templates
# live in presets/nodes/ and are copied in only when the user clicks Add.
# nodes/_system/ is the app-owned kernel, rewritten from core/kernel.js on every
# launch — generated, never authored.
